NotProton-Dormison, 2026-10-10. In native full screen (the green button) a window whose program
made it fixed-size is scaled by Dormison at the size the program drew at: Resident Evil Requiem
in its windowed mode showed 2294x1496 with a black strip and bars. The window is now first
offered the full-screen size, as a resizable one is; RE9 answers by rendering at it (3024x1898,
checked with a SetWindowPos probe). A program that puts its old size back is scaled as before.
NOTPROTON_FULLSCREEN_SCALES=1 keeps the scaling only.

